# CloudShield code ownership — RACI plan §2.2, module map ADR-0002.
#
#   S1 Platform / Infra / CI-CD        @ELSHAHALY
#   S2 App / Identity / Data           @YasseenAbdelghany
#   S3 SecOps / SOAR / Forensics       @ahklsfg
#
# Rules: the LAST matching pattern wins. Every owner listed must have Write
# access to the repo, or GitHub flags the line as an error and ignores it.
# Enable "Require review from Code Owners" in branch protection for main.
#
# IMPORTANT: when a line lists several owners, GitHub needs approval from ANY
# ONE of them, not all. Lines below with two or three owners mean "any of these
# domains may approve". Real two-person review is enforced by branch protection
# ("Required approvals: 2"), not by this file.
#
# Phase F (D11): every path has at least two owners from different roles. A
# PR author's own approval never counts, so a path with its author as the
# ONLY code owner could never pass "Require review from Code Owners".

# Default: anything unmapped needs the platform owner (or SecOps as second).
*                                           @ELSHAHALY @ahklsfg

# ---------------- S1 — Platform / Infra / CI-CD ----------------
/infra/                                     @ELSHAHALY @ahklsfg
/infra/terraform/bootstrap/                 @ELSHAHALY @ahklsfg
/infra/terraform/modules/network/           @ELSHAHALY @ahklsfg
/infra/terraform/modules/compute/           @ELSHAHALY @ahklsfg
/infra/terraform/modules/edge/              @ELSHAHALY @ahklsfg
/Makefile                                   @ELSHAHALY @ahklsfg
/.pre-commit-config.yaml                    @ELSHAHALY @ahklsfg
/.zap/                                      @ELSHAHALY @YasseenAbdelghany

# ---------------- S2 — App / Identity / Data ----------------
/app/                                       @YasseenAbdelghany @ELSHAHALY
/infra/terraform/modules/data/              @YasseenAbdelghany @ELSHAHALY
/infra/terraform/modules/identity/          @YasseenAbdelghany @ELSHAHALY

# ---------------- S3 — SecOps / SOAR / Forensics ----------------
/soar/                                      @ahklsfg @ELSHAHALY
/detection/                                 @ahklsfg @ELSHAHALY
